The portable C in the scenario setup-delay-file: what it is expected to show
otherwise than the original. A patch of harness/goldens/setup-delay-file.txt,
see harness/goldens.py: a line with - is the golden's, a line with + is what
is expected in its place.
Deviation: 5, 14 of src/portable_c/DEVIATIONS.md
Why: Screen and Mouse of the setup has no Screen output: the Other options and
the Mouse options stand five rows further up, where that group was, with the
right half empty below them. The mouse pointer exchanges the colours of the
cell that it is on, the middle of the screen where nothing has moved it: the
lines have moved under it, and it stays. And the Advanced options have no
Quick execute commands: Clear keyboard buffer and what is below it in the box
stand a row further up, the cursor with them where it is on that box, the box
is a row shorter, and the two rows that its last row and the shadow below it
were on show what is behind the box, the upper one in the shadow

